  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-923\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"923\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"495\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-923\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-1\">Introduction</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"923\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <p>Suppose that Bob, who is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.154ex\" height=\"1.557ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 2278 688\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><path data-c=\"31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path><path data-c=\"2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></path><path data-c=\"38\" d=\"M70 417T70 494T124 618T248 666Q319 666 374 624T429 515Q429 485 418 459T392 417T361 389T335 371T324 363L338 354Q352 344 366 334T382 323Q457 264 457 174Q457 95 399 37T249 -22Q159 -22 101 29T43 155Q43 263 172 335L154 348Q133 361 127 368Q70 417 70 494ZM286 386L292 390Q298 394 301 396T311 403T323 413T334 425T345 438T355 454T364 471T369 491T371 513Q371 556 342 586T275 624Q268 625 242 625Q201 625 165 599T128 534Q128 511 141 492T167 463T217 431Q224 426 228 424L286 386ZM250 21Q308 21 350 55T392 137Q392 154 387 169T375 194T353 216T330 234T301 253T274 270Q260 279 244 289T218 306L210 311Q204 311 181 294T133 239T107 157Q107 98 150 60T250 21Z\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" trans